  "That backup is empty.": "Lelo sipele alinalutho.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Lelo sipele lisefomethini engu-{version}, lesi sakhiwo esingazi ukuthi lifundwa kanjani.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Lokho akubukeki njenge-URL. Namathisela isixhumanisi sesengezo, noma esiqala ngo-https://",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Lelo fayela akulona i-JSON, ngakho akulona isipele.",
  "That isn't a Ventic backup.": "Lelo akulona isipele se-Ventic.",
  "That picture couldn't be saved. Try a smaller one, or a JPEG or PNG.": "Leso sithombe asikwazanga ukulondolozwa. Zama esincane, noma i-JPEG noma i-PNG.",
  "That source is already in the list.": "Lowo mthombo usuvele ukhona ohlwini.",
  "That torrent holds no video file.": "Lelo thorenti alinalo ifayela levidiyo.",
  "That's everything.": "Yikho konke lokho.",
  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Uxhumano nenjini yamathorenti lunqamukile phakathi kwesakazo.",
  "The download couldn't be started.": "Ukulanda akukwazanga ukuqala.",
  "The download didn't finish.": "Ukulanda akuqedanga.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Ilinki enikezwe yilo mthombo iphendule nge-HTTP {status}. Kungenzeka iphelelwe yisikhathi — sesha kabusha kwimithombo ukuthola entsha.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Isixhumanisi lo mthombo osinikezile asikwazanga ukufinyelelwa.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Isithombe esingemuva kohlelo lokusebenza njengamanje",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Indawo yomdlali ayikaze ithole usayizi, ngakho ukudlala akuzange kuqalwe.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Umdlali uqobo — ukuhumusha ikhodi, imibhalo engezansi nomsindo. I-GPLv2 noma ngokulandelayo.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Le phrojekthi ayibambi, ayiqhubi, ayivumeli futhi ayincomi noma yimuphi umthombo, futhi ayisabalalisi uhlu lwayo.",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Leli reliza alinaso isibuyekezo saleli plathifomu.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Umthombo usuwuthathile lokhu — kudlala ngokushesha futhi akugcini lutho kule divayisi",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Injini yamathorenti yamukele i-magnet kodwa ayizange iyinike i-IDi.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Injini yamathorenti, efakwe ngaphakathi kohlelo lokusebenza. Inelayisensi ye-MIT.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Ukusakaza kwe-torrent akukalungeli (injini iphendule nge-HTTP {status}). Kungenzeka isathola imethadatha kontanga.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Isibuyekezo asikwazanga ukufakwa: {error}",
  "Theme": "Itimu",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Lapha kunendawo eyanele ifilimu elilodwa nje. Faka idrayivu ye-USB ebhokisini — efomethwe nge-FAT32, wonke amabhokisi e-Android ayayamukela — bese ivela ngenhla ukuze ulande kuyo esikhundleni salokho.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Ayikho i-akhawunti ongangena kuyo futhi akukho okuvumelaniswa neseva. Okubukayo, ukuthi ufinyelele kuphi, izintandokazi zakho nohlu lwakho lokubuka — konke kugcinwa kule divayisi futhi akuphumi kuyo. Ukuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikrini kuhleliwe; kuze kube yileso sikhathi, isipele esingezansi yindlela umtapo othuthelwa ngayo.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Alikho i-{file} efoldeni yakho yamadokhumenti. Kopisha elilodwa lapho bese uzama futhi.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Lolu xhumano lukhokhelwa ngedatha njengamanje.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Lolu xhumano alukhokhelwa ngedatha njengamanje.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Le khophi ayifakwanga umfaki ka-Ventic uqobo — kodwa umphathi wamaphakheji, noma yakhiwe kusuka kumthombo — ngakho lokho okuyibeke lapho yikho okuyibuyekezayo. Ukushintsha amafayela lapha kungayidida nje.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Idikhoda yale divayisi iyekile ukuzama lelo fayela. Imvamisa yingoba kungumsindo: i-Dolby (i-AC-3, i-E-AC-3, i-TrueHD) ne-DTS azinalayisensi kuwebview yesistimu, ngakho ireliza eliphethe elinye lawo lidlala njengesithombe esingenamsindo, noma lingadlali nhlobo. Ireliza le-x264 elinomsindo we-AAC lizodlala.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Leli fayela linethrekhi eyodwa yomsindo.",
  "Timing": "Isikhathi",
  "Tint": "Umbala ongezelelwe",
  "Title": "Isihloko",
  "Too big for the download drive": "Likhulu kakhulu kudrayivu yokulanda",
  "Top rated": "Okulinganiswe phezulu kunakho konke",
