  "Transfers": "Ukudlulisa",
  "Trending": "Okusematheni",
  "Try again": "Zama futhi",
  "Turns off the effects that cost the most to draw: the frosted blur behind the sidebar and menus, the blur on the background art, and the fades and slides that play as things appear or take focus. Everything stays where it was and nothing is hidden — it stops moving and goes crisp instead. Loading spinners keep turning.": "Icisha imiphumela edla kakhulu ekudwebeni: ukufiphala okunjengengilazi ngemuva kwebha eseceleni namamenyu, ukufiphala kwezithombe zesizinda, kanye nokuhwamalala nokushelela okwenzeka lapho izinto zivela noma zithola ukugxila. Konke kuhlala lapho bekukhona futhi akukho okufihliwe — kumane kuyeke ukunyakaza bese kucaca. Izijikelezi zokulayisha ziyaqhubeka nokujikeleza.",
  "Type in the search box to find movies and shows.": "Bhala ebhokisini lokusesha ukuze uthole amafilimu nezinhlelo.",
  "Unmute (m)": "Vula umsindo (m)",
  "Unreadable": "Ayifundeki",
  "Untitled": "Ngaphandle kwesihloko",
  "Upcoming": "Ezizayo",
  "Update now": "Buyekeza manje",
  "Updates": "Izibuyekezo",
  "Updates are checked in the installed app, not here.": "Izibuyekezo zihlolwa kuhlelo lokusebenza olufakiwe, hhayi lapha.",
  "Upload": "Ukulayisha",
  "Use default": "Sebenzisa okuzenzakalelayo",
  "Use this colour": "Sebenzisa lo mbala",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "U-Ventic ucela u-{movie}, noma u-{series}, emthonjeni futhi ulindele ukubuyiselwa uhla lwe-{streams}. Engeza eminingi bese imiphumela yayo ihlanganiswa, okuphindiwe kukhishwe, futhi imithombo eyengezwe kuqala ikhethwe kuqala.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "I-Ventic ilanda iphakheji entsha bese i-Android ikucela ukuba uqinisekise ukufakwa. Isayinwe ngokhiye ofanayo nekhophi onayo, ngakho ithuthukisa endaweni yayo futhi igcine umtapo wakho.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "U-Ventic akanayo imithombo elungiselelwe, ngakho ayikho indawo yokusesha. Usengakwazi ukudlala i-magnet noma ifayela lethorenti oliyivula wena.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "U-Ventic akabambi okuqukethwe, akakuhleli ohlwini, futhi ufika ngaphandle kwemithombo elungiselelwe. Uyiklayenti le-BitTorrent elinomdlali elinamathiselwe kulo: uletha kuphela lokho okumkhombisa kona, kusuka kumaseva owengeze wena.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "U-Ventic unelayisensi ye-MIT. Izingxenye akhelwe phezu kwazo zigcina imibandela yazo, ebalulwe ngenhla; ku-Windows, i-mpv efakiwe iyisofthiwe ye-GPL futhi ilayisensi yayo nesipho somthombo kubekwe eduze kwefayela elisebenzisekayo lohlelo lokusebenza.",
  "Ventic is free and always will be. If it earned one, you can buy me a coffee.": "U-Ventic umahhala futhi uzohlala enjalo. Uma ekufanele, ungangithengela ikhofi.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "U-Ventic usemusha.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "U-Ventic ugcina umtapo wakho kule divayisi. Ukuwuyisa kwesinye isikrini kwenziwa ngefayela lesipele elingezansi.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "U-Ventic akaseshi lutho ngokwakhe. Umthombo yi-URL oyengeza lapha, ekhomba iseva ephendula ngezinto ongazidlala. Ukuthi umthombo unikezani, nokuthi unelungelo yini lokukudlala, kuphakathi kwakho nalowo owuphethe.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "U-Ventic ukhuluma i-{protocol}. Noma iyiphi i-URL yesengezo se-Stremio iyasebenza lapha — namathisela isixhumanisi se-{link} noma ikheli le-{manifest} bese sinqunywa sifike kulokho okudingekayo.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "U-Ventic uzowuthumelela isihloko osifunayo bese edlala lokho awubuyisela khona. Engeza kuphela amaseva owethembayo — leli aliqhutshwa futhi alihlolwa yilolu hlelo lokusebenza.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "U-Ventic {version} usuphumile",
  "Version {version}": "Inguqulo {version}",
  "Vertical position": "Isikhundla esimile",
  "Volume {level}%": "Ivolumu ngo-{level}%",
