  "What a source has to speak": "Ulimi umthombo okumele ulukhulume",
  "What language the app is in, and what language film and show descriptions are fetched in.": "Ulimi uhlelo lokusebenza olukulo, nolimi izincazelo zamafilimu nezinhlelo ezilandwa ngalo.",
  "What sits behind the app": "Okusemuva kohlelo lokusebenza",
  "Whatever the disk allows": "Noma yikuphi idiski ekuvumelayo",
  "Where downloads go": "Lapho okulandiwe kuya khona",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Lapho amafilimu neziqephu kubhalwa khona. Amathorenti asalandiwe ahlala lapho ekhona.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Lapho okulandiwe kugcinwa khona",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Ukuthi amafilimu neziqephu kubhalwa kuyiphi idrayivu — usiphuli olufakiwe luvamise ukuthwala okuningi kakhulu kunebhokisi uqobo. Ukukhipha uhlelo lokusebenza kusakususa. Amathorenti asalandiwe ahlala lapho ekhona.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Kufanelekile ukukuvula nomaphi lapho uhlelo lokusebenza lubonakala lunzima — ikakhulukazi kuthelevishini noma kubhokisi le-set-top, lapho ishipi yamagrafikhi iyingxenye encane yaleyo yelaptop.",
  "Writer": "Umbhali",
  "Writers": "Ababhali",
  "Written {at}.": "Kubhalwe ngo-{at}.",
  "Year": "Unyaka",
  "Your colour": "Umbala wakho",
  "Your own TMDB read token": "Ithokheni yakho yokufunda ye-TMDB",
  "Your sources have nothing for this title.": "Imithombo yakho ayinalutho ngalesi sihloko.",
  "Your watch history, favourites, watchlist, sources and every preference here, written to a single {file}. Carry it to another device and restore it there, or keep one against the day this one is wiped.": "Umlando wakho wokubuka, izintandokazi, uhlu lokubuka, imithombo nazo zonke izilungiselelo lapha, kubhalwe kufayela elilodwa le-{file}. Liyise kwenye idivayisi bese uyalibuyisela lapho, noma ugcine elilodwa ngenxa yosuku lapha kususwa khona konke.",
  "direct link": "isixhumanisi esiqondile",
  "engine offline": "injini ayikho ku-inthanethi",
  "engine running": "injini iyasebenza",
  "mpv exited unexpectedly.": "I-mpv iphume ngokungalindelekile.",
  "of {total} available": "kwezingu-{total} ezitholakalayo",
  "unknown": "akwaziwa",
  "{count} downloading": "{count} kuyalandwa",
  "{count} earlier episodes in this season are still unwatched.": "Iziqephu ezingu-{count} ezandulele kulesi sizini azikabukwa.",
  "{count} earlier seasons are still unwatched.": "Amasizini angu-{count} andulele awakabukwa.",
  "{count} episodes": "Iziqephu ezingu-{count}",
  "{count} lines": "Imigqa engu-{count}",
  "{count} seeders": "Ama-seeder angu-{count}",
  "{drive} is formatted FAT32, which can't hold a single file over {limit}. Bigger releases are dimmed in the source list and are never picked automatically — everything smaller works normally.": "I-{drive} ifomethwe nge-FAT32, engakwazi ukuthwala ifayela elilodwa elidlula u-{limit}. Amareliza amakhulu afiphazwa ohlwini lomthombo futhi awakhethwa ngokuzenzakalela — konke okuncane kusebenza ngokujwayelekile.",
